ce in full. Eppix Labs reserves the right to modify these Terms at any time.</p></div><div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-5 pb-3 border-b border-border/50\"><span class=\"font-mono text-[10px] text-foreground-muted\">01</span><h2 class=\"text-base font-medium text-foreground\">Research Use &amp; Compliance</h2></div><p class=\"text-foreground-secondary text-[13px] leading-relaxed mb-4\">All products sold by Eppix Labs are intended strictly for research and laboratory use only. By completing a purchase, the customer confirms that:</p><ul class=\"space-y-2.5\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-[13px] text-foreground-secondary leading-relaxed\"><span class=\"mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-brand-500 flex-shrink-0\"></span>They are at least 18 years of age, or of legal age in their province or territory</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-[13px] text-foreground-secondary leading-relaxed\"><span class=\"mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-brand-500 flex-shrink-0\"></span>They are purchasing products for legitimate laboratory research purposes only</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-[13px] text-foreground-secondary leading-relaxed\"><span class=\"mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-brand-500 flex-shrink-0\"></span>They understand the materials are not approved by Health Canada for human consumption, therapeutic use, or diagnostic application</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-[13px] text-foreground-secondary leading-relaxed\"><span class=\"mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-brand-500 flex-shrink-0\"></span>They will comply with all applicable federal, provincial, and municipal laws governing research materials</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-[13px] text-foreground-secondary leading-relaxed\"><span class=\"mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-brand-500 flex-shrink-0\"></span>They will not resell, redistribute, or transfer products for human or veterinary use</li></ul></div><div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-5 pb-3 border-b border-border/50\"><span class=\"font-mono text-[10px] text-foreground-muted\">02</span><h2 class=\"text-base font-medium text-foreground\">Accuracy of Information</h2></div><p class=\"text-foreground-secondary text-[13px] leading-relaxed\">Eppix Labs makes every reasonable effort to ensure product descriptions, specifications, pricing, and documentation are accurate. However, errors or omissions may occur. We reserve the right to correct inaccuracies and cancel or refuse orders affected by pricing or listing errors. COAs are batch-specific and published per lot reference.</p></div><div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-5 pb-3 border-b border-border/50\"><span class=\"font-mono text-[10px] text-foreground-muted\">03</span><h2 class=\"text-base font-medium text-foreground\">Sales Policy</h2></div><p class=\"text-foreground-secondary text-[13px] leading-relaxed mb-3\">Due to the nature of research materials, <strong class=\"text-foreground\">all sales are final.</strong> We do not accept returns, exchanges, or offer refunds except:</p><ul class=\"space-y-2.5\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-[13px] text-foreground-secondary leading-relaxed\"><span class=\"mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-border-strong flex-shrink-0\"></span>Orders damaged in transit — contact us with your order number and documentation of damage</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-[13px] text-foreground-secondary leading-relaxed\"><span class=\"mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-border-strong flex-shrink-0\"></span>Incorrect item received — contact us and we will resolve at no additional cost</li></ul></div><div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-5 pb-3 border-b border-border/50\"><span class=\"font-mono text-[10px] text-foreground-muted\">04</span><h2 class=\"text-base font-medium text-foreground\">Payments &amp; Billing</h2></div><p class=\"text-foreground-secondary text-[13px] leading-relaxed mb-5\">All payments must be successfully processed prior to order 